sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Staff
  participant F as staff_pengajuan_izin.php
  participant R as kelola_pengajuan_izin.php
  participant P as proses_pengajuan_izin.php
  participant DB as absensi / pengajuan_izin

  S->>F: submit jenis + date range
  F->>P: ajukan_izin (checks tersedia = jatah - terpakai - tertahan)
  P->>DB: INSERT pengajuan_izin (status=Pending)
  Note over R: Supervisor sees only its branch,<br/>Owner is read-only here
  R->>P: review_izin (approve)
  P->>P: hitungHariIzin() recomputed fresh,<br/>not trusted from submission
  P->>DB: materialisasiIzin():<br/>1 absensi row / effective work day<br/>is_manual_entry = 0
  Note over DB: Dinas Luar is the exception:<br/>never materialised, checked live<br/>at check-in via getIzinDinasDisetujui()
